  "description": {
   "text": "Luck\n(Enchantment/Charm)\n\nLevel: 2\nRange: 15 ft.\nDuration: 15 rounds\nCasting Time: 2\nArea of Effect: 1 creature\nSaving Throw: None\n\nThe recipient of this spell gains extraordinary luck for the next 15 rounds, receiving a +1 bonus to <PRO_HISHER> Saving Throws, attack rolls, and minimum damage/healing rolls as well as +5% to all thieving skills. Furthermore, damage dice for all effects outside a weapon's base damage is reduced by 1. For example, a 6d6 fireball will do 6d5 damage, and a flaming long sword that deals 1d8+2 slashing plus 1d3 fire damage will deal 1d8+2 slashing plus 1d2 fire damage instead.\n\nTyped spell effects: save vs. spell +1 (Luck); save vs. breath +1 (Luck); save vs. polymorph +1 (Luck); save vs. wands +1 (Luck); save vs. death +1 (Luck); Luck +1 (Luck); Values may depend on caster level and target.",
